<title>USA: National Medical sets stock split.</title>
<headline>National Medical sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SPARKS, Nev. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Medical Financial Services Corp Tuesday authorized a 2-for-1 split of its common stock.</p>
<p>It is payable February 24 to shareholders of record February 17.</p>
</text>
